  "item_short_desc": "<p>Looking for a portable and easy-to-carry military duffle for travel, work, everyday use, and more? Our Canvas Equipment Duffle Bags are perfect for storing clothes, small sports gear, spare tools, travel items, and more. Whether you&rsquo;re going to the gym, traveling for the weekend, or exploring the wilderness, keep your gear and equipment alongside you.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2301",
  "description": "<p>Looking for a portable and easy-to-carry military duffle for travel, work, everyday use, and more? Our Canvas Equipment Duffle Bags are perfect for storing clothes, small sports gear, spare tools, travel items, and more. Whether you&rsquo;re going to the gym, traveling for the weekend, or exploring the wilderness, keep your gear and equipment alongside you. Vintage Design: These heavy-duty canvas duffel bags feature military-styled print details on the front, contrasting color stitching, a yellow web pull strap connected to the main storage compartment, and leather pull straps for the front and back zipper pockets. Fast &amp; Easy Access: The main compartment features a full-length, two-way zipper closure that keeps your items safe and secure. These heavy-duty bags include 3 external zipper pockets that are ideal for carrying a cellphone, wallet, keys, and other small essentials. Durable Material Construction: Consisting of 22 oz heavyweight cotton canvas material, these shoulder bags are built tough with reinforced cross-stitching web carry handles that offer additional support for heavy cargo loads and consistent use. Alternative Carrying Options: In addition to the dual carry handles, these canvas tote bags come equipped with a drag handle on the end and an adjustable shoulder strap that extends up to 56 inches. The strap can be removed by detaching the 2 metal clips, allowing you to easily store the canvas duffle in your car or a larger bag. Multiple Sizes Available: These equipment bags come in 2 sizes: 19 inch x 9.5 inch (22 Liter Capacity) and 24 inch x 12 inch (45 Liter Capacity). Top Grade Canvas: Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of ultra-premium canvas bags and packs.</p>",
